  "result": "I fixed it in `src/server/services/member-service.ts:94`. I didn't run the tests.\n\nThe cause: the remove path called `assertLastOwnerRetained(orgId, memberId, \"owner\")`. That check exits early whenever the new role is `\"owner\"`, so removals were never checked and the last owner could be removed. Demotions passed a real lower role, which is why those were still refused.\n\nThe fix makes the remove path pass `\"viewer\"` instead. Removal now counts as losing owner status, so removing the last owner is refused with the same \"transfer ownership first\" error that demotion gives.\n\nThis won't bring back an owner for the organization that already has none. Someone will have to restore one directly, for example by un-archiving the removed member.",
